{{DISPLAYTITLE: <span style="color: #b300b3;">Goblin Drill</span>}}
{{Protection}}{{MagicWords}}

{{Card Infobox|Cost=4|Rarity=Epic|Type=Building|Arena=Serenity Peak|Class=Goblin|ReleaseDate=11 July 2021}}{{SubpageNavBox|Evolution=yes}}{{Quote|Building capable of burrowing underground and appearing anywhere in the Arena. Spawns Goblins one at a time until destroyed. Then spawns a few more, to make sure everything nearby has been properly stabbed.}}

The Goblin Drill is an {{Rarity|Epic}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked from the [[Arenas|Serenity Peak (Arena 14)]]. It spawns a [[:Category:Building Cards|building]] with high hitpoints. The Goblin Drill can be placed anywhere in the Arena. When it resurfaces, it will deal damage to enemy units around it in a 360º area around it, and inflict knockback. Every 3 seconds, the Goblin Drill will passively summon a [[Goblins|Goblin]]. However, its first wave of Goblins will spawn 0.8 seconds after it is deployed. When defeated, it will also spawn two Goblins. It appears as a building with a wooden hull, a circular hatch, a team-colored stripe, and a metal drill on its top. A Goblin Drill card costs 4 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

