==History==
2021
*The Goblin Drill was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Goblin Drill Card Release Draft Challenge]], which started on 12/6/2021. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Goblin Drill. If the player achieved at least 6 wins, they obtained the Goblin Drill early.
*On 17/6/2021, prior to the [[Cards|card]]'s general release, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (17/6/2021)|maintenance break]], added a 1 second delay in its first spawn, adjusted the formation of the [[Goblins]] which spawned upon the Drill's destruction (now spawning more closely together in the center of the Drill), and reduced the push effect of the Drill's burrowing effect on ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]].
*The Goblin Drill card was generally released on 11/7/2021.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], decreased the Goblin Drill's Goblins spawned upon death to 2 (from 3).
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13). It also changed the Goblin Drill's trail to make it more distinct from the [[Miner]]'s and also fixed unintended interaction with Goblin Drill and [[Clone]].
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], fixed an issue where the Goblin Drill's [[Star Points|Star Levels]] used the sound effects of the Miner.
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Drill‘s burrowing speed to 300 (from 400).
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the Goblin's first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.2 seconds). It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Goblin Drill from Rascal's Hideout to Serenity Peak. The same update also added missing particles effects to Goblin Drill’s [[Star Points|Star Level]] 1.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 23/10/2023, the [[Version History#End of October 2023 Update (23/10/2023)|End of October 2023 Update]], increased the Goblin Drill's damage by 1%.
2024
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Drill’s lifetime to 10 seconds (from 9 seconds), decreased the Goblin Drill’s first spawn time to 0.5 seconds (from 1 second), and decreased the Goblin Drill’s hitpoints by 8.9%.
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Drill’s first spawn time to 0.8 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], added the Goblin Drill to the Goblin class.
*On 15/7/2024, the Goblin Drill’s Evolution was added.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Goblin Drill's hitpoints by 0.07% and its damage by 1.2%.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Drill’s first spawn time to 1 seconds (from 0.8 seconds).

